    "note": "kenney.nl asset pages are JS-gated and did not respond to automated curl (connection hung/timeout on /assets/* pages, though kenney.nl root answered 200). Packs were fetched from the ETdoFresh/kenney.nl GitHub mirror, which stores each pack's EXTRACTED files (not a zip). A deterministic zip per pack was assembled locally from the vendored files so an integrity sha256 exists; reproducibility is anchored by the source commit below.",
